I go into the kitchen.
A small box sits on the floor.
I open that box.
There are dishes and food items in the box.
I take the dishes.
I put the dishes in the cupboard.
Now the dishes sit in the cupboard.
There are big jars in the box.
These jars are very heavy.
I put the jars under the counter.
They sit under the counter.
I take my tea tin.
It is my favorite tea.
I put the tea tin on top of the shelf.
Now the tea tin sits on top of the shelf.
I see it there every morning.
My new kitchen is ready now.
